WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
BUILD 009. IT WORKED ELSEWHERE. That proves little here.

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
DECISION. WHAT MUST THIS PLACE DECIDE? Keep the local gap visible.

3
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.000
REQUIREMENTS. NETWORK. POWER. ACCESS. SUPPORT. Add hazards, governance, data, maintenance.

4
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.000
EVIDENCE. CAPACITY IS NOT AN ASSUMPTION. Name sources, owners, gaps, mitigation.

5
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:25.000
PILOT. FALLBACK. STOP. AUTHORITY. High fit permits controlled testing only.

6
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:30.000
TRANSFER. CHANGE PLACE; CHANGE ANSWER. Technology never travels alone.
